        "date": "2026-11-20T23:36:03Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): refuse a 3+2 down-pointing tool axis that can go under the table\n\nPast a 90-degree head tilt the tool axis points down toward the machine\ntable. The move from the tool-change height along it to the clearance\nplane can end under the table top. #2987 gave only a note there, so the\npost did not stop. The new verdict Warning::FirstTraverseUnderTable names\nthe highest plane that keeps the move over the table and says \"lower the\nclearance plane\", never \"raise\". It blocks the post. Tilted caches read\nStale once (salt first-traverse-table-3081).\n\nFixes #3081\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
