      },
      "message": "fix(examples): restamp the tilted example caches for the #3081 law\n\nThe tilted operations of three shipped projects read Stale once under the\nnew salt. Regenerated by the current law, their warnings, notes and moves\nare the same (max deviation 5e-7 mm, the file's rounding), so only the\nstamps change. No .nc file changes. The pinning test now reads the\nverdict text, because this rig's B 120 face also fails the Z stroke law,\nwhich refuses the post first.\n\nRefs #3081\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
